<%#
# Key: skills/feedback/unknown
# Purpose: Unknown-skill Tool feedback.
# Used: Returned to the model when LittleGhost produces unknown-skill Tool feedback.
# Locals:
# - name: Name of the Tool, skill, path, or resource referenced by the prompt.
# - available: Names available for the model to choose from.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
-%>
Unknown skill: <%= name %><% unless available.empty? %>. Available skills: <%= available.join(", ") %><% end %>
